{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619290/extras/0e60a0cf90ae3e77af2161bc8d346070.poster.avif?t=1770121320\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619290/extras/0e60a0cf90ae3e77af2161bc8d346070.webm?t=1770121320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619290/extras/0e60a0cf90ae3e77af2161bc8d346070.mp4?t=1770121320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Action Horror Escape Game \u2013 Sharpen your reflexes and memory to find the exit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relentlessly pursued by looming terror, you must keep running in this ultimate survival challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A single moment of hesitation could mean the end. Experience fear and thrill beyond the boundaries of gaming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619290/extras/03be9d25d6faa5b6f1bc7c8e31489a84.avif?t=1770121320\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619290/extras_big/03be9d25d6faa5b6f1bc7c8e31489a84.avif?t=1770121320 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[A Space Full of Mysteries]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is no ordinary exploration game. The visuals progress in real time, leaving no room for contemplation.<br>Your only allies are your reflexes and memory.<br>In an atmosphere so tense it drives you to the brink of madness, the sole path to survival is finding the exit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619290/extras/db488d457198cb0766dc17024a4246e4.avif?t=1770121320\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619290/extras_big/db488d457198cb0766dc17024a4246e4.avif?t=1770121320 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Story]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cold floor jolts the girl awake. Her head is foggy. Where\u2026 is this place?<br>On her way home, something suddenly dragged her away\u2014then, nothing.<br>As she opens her eyes, she finds herself in an unfamiliar, eerie space. Flickering lights, a damp stench, the sound of dripping water breaking the silence.<br>Then\u2014<br>A distant scream pierces the air.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;GYAAAAAH!!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her body freezes in terror.<br>From the darkness, slow, creaking footsteps draw closer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something is here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She must run. But there is no exit.<br>And so begins a nightmare escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619290/extras/4b4620d15cd976eaeb4319c1d621b93e.avif?t=1770121320\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619290/extras_big/4b4620d15cd976eaeb4319c1d621b93e.avif?t=1770121320 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Stunning Visuals]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With breathtaking graphics, this game amplifies the feeling of immersive horror to the absolute limit.<br>The hyper-realistic visuals make you feel as though you\u2019ve been thrown into a horror movie.<br>As you flee in terror, one question remains\u2014can you survive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619290/extras/2c32c9fb4e6792e5913392a830bd0fdc.avif?t=1770121320\" data-big-src=http